\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ewps-office:latest\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003exbackbone:latest\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003eStill waiting on a distro fix: all images based on Debian 13, Ubuntu, Fedora 44 and Kali (most of the Selkies-based images, including the Debian, Ubuntu and Fedora flavours of webtop), and \u003ccode\u003ediskover\u003c/code\u003e and \u003ccode\u003eprojectsend\u003c/code\u003e, which are on older Alpine releases that have no fixed nginx package.\u003c/p\u003e\n","createdAt":"2026-11-19 12:00:00 +0000 UTC","lastMod":"2026-11-19 09:07:11 -0500 -0500","permalink":"https://info.linuxserver.io/issues/2026-11-19-nginx-http2-cves/","severity":"","resolved":false,"informational":true,"resolvedAt":"","affected":["Vulnerabilities"],"filename":"2026-11-19-nginx-http2-cves.md"}